{"id":"1677d7f7248ffdaa","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-arslanov.md","title":"Arslanov完备性判据","display":"thm-arslanov — Arslanov完备性判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-arslanov","aliases":["43-thm-arslanov"],"display":"thm-arslanov — Arslanov完备性判据","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-dnc]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-thm-dnc-fpf]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.19.3, print p.74 / PDF p.94","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-arslanov"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-arslanov</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arslanov — Arslanov完备性判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"91bfa9b664aabf49\" href=\"?note=91bfa9b664aabf49\" title=\"43-thm-dnc-fpf\">43-thm-dnc-fpf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.19.3, print p.74 / PDF p.94"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>且A为c.e.集。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(A\\equiv_T\\varnothing\\prime\\leftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{FPF}(f))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(A\\equiv_T\\varnothing\\prime\\leftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{FPF}(f))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>c.e.假设不可删；高于∅′的任意度并非都等于∅′。来源以递归定理建立编号受控的c.e.集，借FPF性质从A恢复停机集。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.19.3, print p.74 / PDF p.94。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed"